# SleepHelper 🌙

SleepHelper is a personal embedded project built with **ESP32**. Its goal is to monitor sleep-related environmental conditions and calculate a **Sleep Score** based on multiple factors.

## Current features

- OLED display with custom UI
- Digital clock
- Temperature & humidity monitoring
- Light level monitoring
- Menu navigation with buttons
- Button debouncing
- Modular C++ architecture
- Sleep Score system _(in development)_

## Planned features

- Sleep Score calculation
- Alarm with sound output
- Automatic sleep/environment monitoring
- CO₂ and noise monitoring
- Configurable settings
- Persistent data storage
- Mobile application _(later)_

## Technologies

- **ESP32**
- **C++ / Arduino**
- **PlatformIO**
- **OLED 128×64**
- **DHT22**
- Various analog/digital sensors

> 🚧 SleepHelper is currently a work in progress.
